{"id":"gracioso","lemma":"gracioso","pos":"adj","rank":640,"glosses":["funny, amusing","silly (playful, giggly)","facetious, cute"],"ipa":"/ɡɾaˈθjoso/","forms":{"feminine":"graciosa","masculinePlural":"graciosos","femininePlural":"graciosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gracioso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué es tan gracioso?","en":"What's so funny?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442262"},{"text":"Esa broma no es graciosa.","en":"That joke isn't funny.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461080"},{"text":"Tus chistes no son graciosos.","en":"Your jokes aren't funny."},{"text":"Tus bromas no son graciosas.","en":"Your jokes aren't funny.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804218"},{"text":"Eso no es gracioso.","en":"That's not funny.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444313"}]}